- function:
    name: {{prefix}}admit
    schema: {{schema}}
  configuration:
    exposed_as: mutation
  permissions:
    - role: {{server_role}}
  comment: "Admits a user, handing them free credits from the month's pool when nothing is left. Answers the balance; above zero is admitted. The server role alone, and the function checks the role again itself. Never add a user-facing or AI role."
- function:
    name: {{prefix}}spend
    schema: {{schema}}
  configuration:
    exposed_as: mutation
  permissions:
    - role: {{server_role}}
  comment: "One ledger row converted into credits at the price and ratio in force when it was made, and taken free first. Idempotent. The server role alone, and the function checks the role again itself. Never add a user-facing or AI role."
- function:
    name: {{prefix}}grant
    schema: {{schema}}
  configuration:
    exposed_as: mutation
  permissions:
    - role: {{server_role}}
  comment: "The admin granting credits or taking some back, never below nothing, written down with the reason and the admin. The server role alone, and the function checks the role again itself. Never add a user-facing or AI role."
- function:
    name: {{prefix}}claim_out_notice
    schema: {{schema}}
  configuration:
    exposed_as: mutation
  permissions:
    - role: {{server_role}}
  comment: "Claims telling a user they ran out this month; answers the row only for the call that claimed it. The server role alone, and the function checks the role again itself. Never add a user-facing or AI role."
- function:
    name: {{prefix}}set_model_price
    schema: {{schema}}
  configuration:
    exposed_as: mutation
  permissions:
    - role: {{server_role}}
  comment: "A model's price set whole, from a moment on. The server role alone, and the function checks the role again itself. Never add a user-facing or AI role."
- function:
    name: {{prefix}}purchase_open
    schema: {{schema}}
  configuration:
    exposed_as: mutation
  permissions:
    - role: {{server_role}}
  comment: "A purchase opened at the price in force, before Stripe is asked. The server role alone, and the function checks the role again itself. Never add a user-facing or AI role."
- function:
    name: {{prefix}}refill_claim
    schema: {{schema}}
  configuration:
    exposed_as: mutation
  permissions:
    - role: {{server_role}}
  comment: "Claims an automatic refill if one is due, one at a time and within the month's maximum. The server role alone, and the function checks the role again itself. Never add a user-facing or AI role."
- function:
    name: {{prefix}}credit
    schema: {{schema}}
  configuration:
    exposed_as: mutation
  permissions:
    - role: {{server_role}}
  comment: "Credits what Stripe says was paid, once per event id and once per purchase. The server role alone, and the function checks the role again itself. Never add a user-facing or AI role."
- function:
    name: {{prefix}}refill_failed
    schema: {{schema}}
  configuration:
    exposed_as: mutation
  permissions:
    - role: {{server_role}}
  comment: "A refill that could not be charged: failed, auto-refill turned off. The server role alone, and the function checks the role again itself. Never add a user-facing or AI role."
- function:
    name: {{prefix}}apply_proposal
    schema: {{schema}}
  configuration:
    exposed_as: mutation
  permissions:
    - role: {{server_role}}
  comment: "A proposed price applied from now. The server role alone, and the function checks the role again itself. Never add a user-facing or AI role."
